<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Thursday, small supply slaughter steers and heifers steady to $0.50 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>**Slaughter Steers: Few Choice 2-4 1275-1400 lbs 63.75-65.00.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 **50-1400 lbs 62.90-63.75.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Few Choice 2-4 1150-1350 lbs 63.50-65.73.</p>
<p>Few Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1200 lbs 62.00-62.50.</p>
</text>
